AlgoPulse ⚡
AlgoPulse is an automated crypto perpetual futures and options trading suite modeled directly on professional mobile exchange interfaces like CoinDCX. It features 15 built-in technical strategies, a multi-coin technical screener, VWAP session charts, and a dual demo/real execution router with HMAC-SHA256 signature support.
App Specifications
App Name: AlgoPulse
Version: v3.0.0 Master Edition
Created By: Vicky Bhalerao
Established: 2026
Repository Structure (main branch)
Your GitHub repository main branch should contain exactly these 3 files:
algopulse_v3.py — The core Python application script (UI, indicators, backtester, execution router).
requirements.txt — The dependency configuration file required by Streamlit Cloud.
README.md — This project documentation file.
